{# =========================================================================
   Typesense front-end fragment: conversational answer
   =========================================================================
   The RAG answer region plus its cited source hits. Rendered one-shot (the full
   answer at once) for the no-JS path and on servers without streaming; on a
   streaming server the answer region is seeded empty and each token is appended
   into #ts-answer over SSE, then #ts-answer-sources is patched in.

   Keeps its #ts-answer id (the streaming morph target). Override by copying this
   file (and _ask-sources) into your configured front-end templates directory.

   Variables:
   - answer:    the generated answer text (may be empty)
   - result:    the Typesense response (reads result.hits for citations)
   - urls:      element URLs keyed by element id
   - theme:     the merged theme config
   ========================================================================= #}
{%- set theme = theme ?? {} -%}
<div{{ craft.typesense.attr(theme, 'answer', 'ts-answer whitespace-pre-line') }} id="ts-answer">
    {%- if answer -%}
        {{ answer|nl2br }}
    {%- else -%}
        <span class="ts-answer__empty text-gray-500">{{ 'No answer.'|t('typesense') }}</span>
    {%- endif -%}
</div>

{{ craft.typesense.component('_ask-sources', { result: result, urls: urls, theme: theme }) }}
